Patch 6014: ppu_lifter --fn-hooks FILE, entry/exit wrappers around chosen function entries.

Authored SDK extension, rebased from the private port's patch 6014. Optional end guards and overlapping-entry rejection use the
final emitted function set. Wrappers retain the original name for direct calls, table dispatch and trampoline targets; separately
emitted interior entries are refused. A tail/fallthrough body is refused because leave would run before its continuation. Hook
symbols must be C identifiers; duplicate/missing entries and invalid/changed ends stop the lift. No option means unchanged output.
The emitted numeric range marker supports independent build verification. Test: installer/tools/lod_hooks_test.py (synthetic PPC).
No original game statements or bytes are in this patch.

